  "notes": ["The retained first-input inlets come from the two loaded-actor entry prefixes. The collision grid is declared empty and initialized; stage dispatch 1 uses its original no-op handler.","Each B fork checks its one-stock debit at the original factory entry separately from the retained complete coordinator calls.","The retained calls execute the actor pass, live carrier buckets, collision lists, original collision walk and the coordinator tail. The three observed scene counters each advance by one.","A successful parent keeps the normal paying actor and clones view record 3 from its source archive. The shape in both registries is a single original shape, not two independently owned hits.","The tested successful initializer chooses 180 lifetime units. No timer or position is overwritten for expiry; the only kind-3 cell is the parent, so the key-19 request cannot allocate a child.","These complete source callbacks use declared resources and muted audio; the startup prefixes do not replay the entire preceding world. No live arena, original hardware, general damage timing or native gameplay is qualified."],
